OL,3,AIndia's 'cockroach' party founder
OL,4,Adetained ahead of protest
OL,5,
OL,6,FAbhijeet Dipke, the founder of India's
OL,7,F"cockroach" movement, and a few others
OL,8,Fwere detained in Delhi as police tried
OL,9,Fto stop a protest demanding the
OL,10,Fresignation of the country's election
OL,11,Fchief.
OL,13,FHundreds had gathered in Connaught
OL,14,FPlace, one of the capital's busiest
OL,15,Fcommercial districts, waving Indian
OL,16,Fflags and shouting slogans despite a
OL,17,Fheavy security presence.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,317,300,200,140,0,100
