OL,3,AIndia's 'cockroach' party founder
OL,4,Adetained ahead of protest
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice sealed off Central Park, the
OL,7,Fplanned site of the protest, and
OL,8,Fdeployed thousands of police and
OL,9,Fparamilitary personnel to prevent the
OL,10,Fgathering.
OL,12,FThe Gen Z-led Cockroach Janta Party
OL,13,F(CJP) accuses India's Election
OL,14,FCommission of manipulating voter lists
OL,15,Fto favour Prime Minister Narendra
OL,16,FModi's ruling BJP. Both deny the
OL,17,Fallegation.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
